[{"title":"踏莎行 题破窗风雨图和王筠庵韵","author":"金炯","text":"草带残编，荷衣断袂。\n破窗风雨深深闭。\n江南倦客正思家，灯花摇梦来乡里。\n翠竹檐前，碧蕉丛里。\n秋声斗合愁心碎。\n不教潘鬓总成霜，也应有泪如铅水。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5776,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"一叶舟","author":"侯善渊","text":"颠倒一阳初起。\n万化混元同体。\n光灿射瑶宫。\n满堂红。\n了正圆明开启。\n上下贯穿无底。\n天地悉空皆空。\n太玄中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5777,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"一叶舟","author":"侯善渊","text":"海底凝珠鲜洁。\n天上莹然清绝。\n中道太虚宽。\n滚神丹。\n光胜一轮秋月。\n照鉴本无圆缺。\n清爽逼人寒。\n透琅玕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5778,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"一叶舟","author":"侯善渊","text":"大道孤然独立。\n善用本元辙迹。\n寰海好云游。\n玩清秋。\n月色扶空澄瑞，微现桂红轻翠。\n嘉景最奇幽。\n赛瀛洲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5779,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"一叶舟","author":"侯善渊","text":"照海凝珠光灿。\n贵贱不分弹雀。\n可惜本来珍。\n污泥津。\n认取勿令差错。\n莹净免繁萦缚。\n决正出嚣尘。\n玩长春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5780,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"一叶舟","author":"侯善渊","text":"不觉形躯衰老。\n受尽许多萦恼。\n谁肯死前休。\n苦贪求。\n识破修行早早。\n认取自家珍宝。\n珍宝价无酬。\n永存留。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5781,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"一叶舟","author":"侯善渊","text":"大道本无一物。\n遍纳十方充塞。\n无外亦无心。\n不容针。\n要见阐开清目。\n认得本元虚谷。\n非浅亦非深。\n满壶金。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5782,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"一叶舟","author":"侯善渊","text":"道契希夷恍惚，辩正其中有物。\n物物自然通。\n尽包容。\n月白风清满目。\n宝篆玲珑馥郁。\n寥落遍精空。\n有无中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5783,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"一叶舟","author":"侯善渊","text":"摆脱尘情冤业。\n此是利名休歇。\n清净谨威仪。\n宴瑶池。\n水静澄澄冰洁。\n显焕碧潭秋月。\n月里悟丹枝。\n性光辉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5784,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"一叶舟","author":"侯善渊","text":"顶笠披莎归去。\n渐入芦花深处。\n绿岸缆渔舟。\n钓纶收。\n轻泛壶中一味。\n野鹤孤云相济。\n横管韵清幽。\n乐无愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5785,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"一叶舟","author":"侯善渊","text":"万象冲开寥廓。\n元气混然虚托。\n海月晏晶金。\n照天心。\n睫外威神辉豁。\n冰体雪肌绰约。\n稳稳过琼琳。\n上瑶岑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5786,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"一叶舟","author":"侯善渊","text":"运动一阳初出。\n照破太空微密。\n万象总潜形。\n炫然明。\n凝化鼎中灵质。\n丹就刹那功毕。\n仙子上云英。\n玩蓬瀛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c0685