a33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"侯善渊","text":"恣遨游。\n玩清秋。\n掩映曹溪细水流。\n琼花两岸秋。\n满浮沤。\n饮忘愁。\n日落星稀月上楼。\n沉沉醉玉洲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5793,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"侯善渊","text":"道无边。\n性光圆。\n认得龟蛇两下缠。\n阴阳合地天。\n汞和铅。\n气神全。\n光迸流霞耀晃然。\n方知玄又玄。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5794,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"侯善渊","text":"秘精精。\n满盈盈。\n密扣金关逆上行。\n玄珠颗颗倾。\n内灵灵。\n外明明。\n内外相交一点星。\n飞腾上玉瑛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5795,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"侯善渊","text":"道心宁。\n慧灯明。\n玩宝童儿启道经。\n清如佩玉声。\n湛然澄。\n焕然凝。\n燕静华池吞玉瑛。\n还纯体自贞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5796,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"捣练子","author":"侯善渊","text":"真藏假，假藏真。\n释然独体绝疏亲。\n混元中，无我人。\n神通道，道通神。\n澄澄虚璧若冰轮。\n辗天河，出六尘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5797,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"捣练子","author":"侯善渊","text":"修行事，谨推寻。\n无生无灭道相任。\n易晴空，识本心。\n明动静，定浮沉。\n玉婴常守满壶金。\n彩霞辉，散宝岑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":5798,"sha256":"83a9b